 "name": "CSS Selectors as Fragment Identifiers Community Group",
 "is_closed": true,
 "creation-date": "2012-03-02",
 "description": "Decades after the web emerged, hypertext creators pointing to a specific place in a resource they don't control still have to hope or beg that there's a convenient link anchor placed there by the author.  CSS selectors let us point anywhere in a document - let's bring them to hypertext!\r\n \r\nYou can see a very rough initial plan of this at http://simonstl.com/articles/cssFragID.html.",
